# The backend's public origin (its APP_URL), no trailing slash. The Mini App
# calls its JSON API from https://h5.zdn.vn: that origin must be in the
# backend's CORS_ORIGINS, and ZALO_APP_SECRET set there for the position and
# phone buttons. Copy to .env (development) or .env.production (deploy).
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5173
